"x='349' y='102'>14</text></g><text x='133' y='116' font-family='sans-serif' "
"font-size='7' fill='#6d4f24'>09:00 Lěkar</text><text x='20' y='150' font-"
"family='sans-serif' font-size='9' fill='#5a4630'>Čerwjeny wobrys: dźensa</"
"text><text x='20' y='166' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='9' "
